<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 0.28 point off FTSE on Sep 2.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 0.28 point off FTSE on Sep 2.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 index stock will go ex-dividend on September 2 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 0.28 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>    * Pearson			 6.90  8.625  0.284</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
